  step=2,dige:1db1015083c51b61,desc:a Desk believing a pond marked to attend the run loop — and a pond beside it unmarked — poke both clocks once
    Assertion:a-pulse-poked-into,sentence:a pulse poked into a pond marked to attend the run loop moves it on the House’s own think — nobody called a run
